    "loreStatements": {
      "v": [
        {
          "text": "- **Lorekeeper / mentor-mask:** an apparently authoritative librarian can be genuinely helpful yet deliberately offer a *neighboring* contradictory Card instead of the one asked for. The player infers the interpretation; the librarian is not the author's ultimate answer.",
